    LLM: "Use reserve and tableau cards to foundations before turning a hand card; fill empty tableau spaces from reserve when possible; load onto opponent's reserve or waste to block them.\n\nPlan order of plays to satisfy compulsory moves while maximizing options; prefer moves that expose new reserve or tableau cards.\n\nTrack which cards are in opponent's hand and waste; time loading onto opponent to maximize their dead cards; avoid leaving tableau cards that only you can use.",
